{"id":"n15906-2-9","stage":3,"title":"건조 · 干燥","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15906-2-9-1","ko":"건조 다 끝났어?","zh":"烘干都做完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건조","meaning":"干燥，晒干，烘干","explanation":"건조：干燥，晒干，烘干","readings":[{"term":"건조","audio":"/audio/2a0d9757ce8c150819f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15906","senseId":"2","lemma":"건조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건조","audio":"/audio/2a0d9757ce8c150819f8.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"끝났어?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝났어","audio":"/audio/df5875f0b69e4d6fee40.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a0d9757ce8c1508","term":"건조","zh":"干燥，晒干，烘干","audio":"/audio/2a0d9757ce8c150819f8.mp3","entryId":"15906","definition":"弄干，去掉水分或湿气。","pronunciation":["건조"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/77d105985a0ce5e391ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15906-2-9-2","ko":"물기가 아직 있는 걸 보니 아직 다 안 마른 것 같아요.","zh":"看上面还有湿气，应该还没完全干呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물기가","meaning":"潮气，水分","explanation":"물기：潮气，水分；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물기","audio":"/audio/0e2d8d28de0f93d8737d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15419","senseId":"1","lemma":"물기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물기가","audio":"/audio/f0e54117bdbe25e53857.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"(反语)表示“永远地”、“完全地”，用于不可实现的未来事情。","explanation":"다：(反语)表示“永远地”、“完全地”，用于不可实现的未来事情。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"5","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"提案，方案","explanation":"안：提案，方案","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14773","senseId":"2","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"마른","meaning":"干","explanation":"마르다：干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"1","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마른","audio":"/audio/640992b998952ba64e4f.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0e2d8d28de0f93d8","term":"물기","zh":"潮气，水分","audio":"/audio/0e2d8d28de0f93d8737d.mp3","entryId":"15419","definition":"湿润的水气。","pronunciation":["물끼"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"(反语)表示“永远地”、“完全地”，用于不可实现的未来事情。","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"(反语)表示“永远地”、“完全地”，用于不可实现的未来事情。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"提案，方案","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"14773","definition":"经过考虑想出的主意或计划。","pronunciation":["안ː"]},{"id":"6cd2f7184df80453","term":"마르다","zh":"干","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3","entryId":"64677","definition":"水分全部蒸发而消失。","pronunciation":["마르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d117de090fd402c3548.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.708,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15906","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5347,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看上面还有湿气，应该还没完全干呢。","烘干都做完了吗？","我们还是步行上楼梯吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["烘干都做完了吗？","我们还是步行上楼梯吧。","看上面还有湿气，应该还没完全干呢。"],"answer":2}]}
